flowchart TD
    A[Template Library] -->|New Template| B{Choose Mode}
    A -->|Empty state CTA| B
    B -- Describe a Scenario --> C1[Setup: Scenario prompt + category + difficulty]
    B -- Copy an Email --> C2[Setup: .eml upload + optional screenshot + difficulty]
    C1 --> D[Generate Template]
    C2 --> D
    D --> E{Generation result}
    E -- Success within ~10s --> F[Edit and Preview: WYSIWYG canvas + desktop/mobile toggle]
    E -- Failure --> C1err[Inline error, Try again, inputs preserved]
    C1err --> D

    F --> G{Change difficulty?}
    G -- No --> H[Manual edits in canvas]
    G -- Yes, click Regenerate --> I[Confirm: discard edits and regenerate?]
    I -- Cancel --> F
    I -- Confirm --> D

    H --> J[Click Save]
    J --> K{Name and category set?}
    K -- No --> L[Inline naming and category step]
    K -- Yes --> M{Duplicate name in workspace?}
    L --> M
    M -- Yes --> Lerr[Inline validation error, rename required]
    Lerr --> L
    M -- No --> N[Template saved, status Ready]

    N --> O[Template Detail]
    O -->|Use in Campaign, deploy permission required| P[Hand off to Campaign Launcher]
    O -->|No deploy permission| Q[Disabled button with tooltip]
    O -->|Delete| R[Confirm delete - campaign-link behavior open issue]
    O -->|Edit| F

    A -->|View-only role| S[Read-only Library, no New Template action]
    F -->|View-only role| T[Read-only canvas, Regenerate and Save hidden]
